# agent memory symlink (AGENTS.md is the committed standard)
CLAUDE.md

# S-12 cutover rehearsal: the identity record (pid + port + process start time) of the anvil that
# scripts/rehearse-cutover.sh started. Re-verified before any kill, so a recycled pid is refused
# rather than signalled. Stop a stranded fork with `scripts/rehearse-cutover.sh --stop`.
.anvil-rehearsal.pid
